event: node_complete
data: {"id": "e87b9b5d7b554a3e-node_complete-layer", "run_id": "e87b9b5d7b554a3e", "seq": 17, "ts_ms": 1789122691484, "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "duration_seconds": 23.045, "state_snapshot": {"layer": "Layer.ABNORMAL", "layers": ["ABNORMAL"], "layer_confidence": 0.5, "layer_reasoning": "1. **异常识别**: 集群中存在一个异常 Pod `workload` (Namespace: `aiops-case-v05`)，状态为 `ContainerCreating`。\n2. **事件分析**: 根据 `kubectl get events` 结果，该 Pod 持续报错 `Warning FailedMount`，错误信息为：\n   - `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key`\n   - `Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]... timed out waiting for the condition`\n3. **根因推导**: \n   - 错误信息明确指出 ConfigMap `workload-input` 中引用的 key `unavailable-key` 不存在。\n   - 虽然 ConfigMap 对象 `workload-input` 存在（根据 `kubectl_get_by_kind_in_cluster` for ConfigMaps 显示有该对象，且 `kubectl_get_by_name` 显示其有1个DATA项，很可能就是缺失那个key或者key名不匹配），但 Pod 的 Volume 挂载依赖该特定 key，导致挂载失败。\n   - 这符合 Runbook 中 `Step 3A: ConfigMap/Secret volume 缺失分支` 的情况，即 `configmap references non-existent config key`。\n4. **状态判定**: Pod 处于 `ContainerCreating` 且因挂载错误阻塞，属于活跃异常。\n5. **结论**: 异常类型为 `VolumeMountFailed` (具体为 ConfigMap Key 缺失)。\n", "layer_analysis": "{\"layer\": \"DIAGNOSIS\", \"derived_layer\": \"\", \"layers\": [], \"layer_name\": \"\", \"confidence\": 0.5, \"reasoning\": \"1. **异常识别**: 集群中存在一个异常 Pod `workload` (Namespace: `aiops-case-v05`)，状态为 `ContainerCreating`。\\n2. **事件分析**: 根据 `kubectl get events` 结果，该 Pod 持续报错 `Warning FailedMount`，错误信息为：\\n   - `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \\\"input\\\" : configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key`\\n   - `Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]... timed out waiting for the condition`\\n3. **根因推导**: \\n   - 错误信息明确指出 ConfigMap `workload-input` 中引用的 key `unavailable-key` 不存在。\\n   - 虽然 ConfigMap 对象 `workload-input` 存在（根据 `kubectl_get_by_kind_in_cluster` for ConfigMaps 显示有该对象，且 `kubectl_get_by_name` 显示其有1个DATA项，很可能就是缺失那个key或者key名不匹配），但 Pod 的 Volume 挂载依赖该特定 key，导致挂载失败。\\n   - 这符合 Runbook 中 `Step 3A: ConfigMap/Secret volume 缺失分支` 的情况，即 `configmap references non-existent config key`。\\n4. **状态判定**: Pod 处于 `ContainerCreating` 且因挂载错误阻塞，属于活跃异常。\\n5. **结论**: 异常类型为 `VolumeMountFailed` (具体为 ConfigMap Key 缺失)。\\n\", \"abnormal_pods\": [{\"name\": \"workload\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-v05\", \"status\": \"ContainerCreating\"}], \"pod_status_keyword\": \"ContainerCreating\", \"pod_abnormal_type\": \"ConfigMap 中引用的 key 缺失导致挂载失败\", \"status_category\": \"ABNORMAL\", \"key_entities\": [{\"type\": \"Pod\", \"name\": \"workload\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-v05\"}, {\"type\": \"ConfigMap\", \"name\": \"workload-input\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-v05\"}], \"possible_scenarios\": [{\"scenario\": \"ConfigMap 中引用的 key 缺失导致挂载失败\", \"probability\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"Events 明确提示 'configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key'，且 Pod 持续处于 ContainerCreating 状态并超时。\"}], \"abnormal_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"g1\", \"status_keywords\": [\"ContainerCreating\"], \"pod_abnormal_type\": \"ContainerCreating\", \"compatible_layers\": [], \"entities\": [{\"kind\": \"Pod\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-v05\", \"name\": \"workload\"}], \"evidence_plan\": [], \"possible_scenarios\": [{\"scenario\": \"ContainerCreating 的直接原因待验证\", \"probability\": \"未知\", \"reason\": \"当前阶段只定位异常；根因必须由后续实时 canonical facts 确认\"}], \"matched_runbooks\": [\"pod-volume-mount-failed.md\"]}], \"issue_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"g1\", \"status_keywords\": [\"ContainerCreating\"], \"pod_abnormal_type\": \"ContainerCreating\", \"compatible_layers\": [], \"entities\": [{\"kind\": \"Pod\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-v05\", \"name\": \"workload\"}], \"evidence_plan\": [], \"possible_scenarios\": [{\"scenario\": \"ContainerCreating 的直接原因待验证\", \"probability\": \"未知\", \"reason\": \"当前阶段只定位异常；根因必须由后续实时 canonical facts 确认\"}], \"matched_runbooks\": [\"pod-volume-mount-failed.md\"]}], \"current_abnormal_summary\": 