stent config key: unavailable-key`，直接指向配置缺失；\n- 证据 2、3、7 显示 Pod 持续处于 `ContainerCreating` / `Pending` 状态，与挂载失败导致的阻塞行为一致；\n- 证据 8 表明容器未运行过，排除应用侧错误。\n\n现有证据已足够明确，无需补充日志或追踪数据即可定论。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 23.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 32.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v05/workload: 32.9s (Evidence 27.0s, RCA 5.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v05/workload**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 65.805, "metrics": {"run_id": "e87b9b5d7b554a3e", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 65.81388545036316, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total